        "content": "## 02 \u00b7 Research Paper Search & Collection\nDaily 08:00 \u2192 every **active** topic in `research_topics` \u2192 arXiv + Semantic Scholar \u2192 dedupe (arXiv ID \u2192 DOI \u2192 title+year, per topic, merging metadata) \u2192 skip papers already stored \u2192 LLM relevance (\u2265 0.70) \u2192 insert into `research_papers` with `processed=false`, `processing_status=pending_ai`.\nAPI failures are retried 3\u00d7 then treated as zero results.\n**Credentials**: OpenAI \u00b7 Semantic Scholar (Header Auth `x-api-key`).",
